{"strongs": "H6659", "word": "צָדוֺק", "translit": "tsa.doq", "root": "צדוק", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Zadok", "definition": "צָדוֺק , and ( 1Kgs 1:26 ) צָדֹק 54 proper name, masculine (just, righteous; compare Sabean proper name צדק CIS iv, No. 287, 1.2.11.15 etc. , DHM Hof Museum, No. 32 ); — σαδωκ, σαδδονκ (compare Lag BN 225 ff. ); — 1. 48 priests: \\ \\ a. David's time 2Sam 8:17 = 1Chr 18:16 ; 2Sam 15:24 ; 2Sam 15:25 + 23 t. Samuel Kings Chronicles, + (Solomon's time) 1Kgs 2:35 = 1Chr 29:22 ; 1Kgs 4:2 ; 1Kgs 4:4 ancestor of דְּנֵי צָדוֺק Ezek 40:46 ; Ezek 44:15 ; Ezek 48:11 , ׳ זֶרַע צ Ezek 43:19 , ׳ בֵּית צ 2Chr 31:10 descendant of Eleazar 1Chr 5:34 (twice in verse) + 5t. Chronicles. \\ \\ b. 1Chr 5:38 (twice in verse), possibly = \\ \\ c. 1Chr 9:11 ; Neh 11:11 . 2. father-in-law of Uzziah 2Kgs 15:33 = 2Chr 27:11 . 3. two wall-builders: \\ \\ a. Neh 3:4 . \\ \\ b. v Neh 3:29 perhaps = \\ \\ c. Neh 10:22 , and \\ \\ d. הַסּוֺפֵר ׳ צ Neh 13:13 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6945')\">BDB6945</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6659')\">H6659</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6944')\">BDB6944</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6946')\">BDB6946</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>צָדוֺק</bdbheb>, and (<ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:26\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,26)\">1Kgs 1:26</ref>) <bdbheb>צָדֹק</bdbheb><sub>54</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (just, righteous; compare Sabean proper name <bdbheb>צדק</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('CIS')\">CIS<sup>iv, No. 287, 1.2.11.15 etc.</sup></lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>Hof Museum, No. 32</sup></lookup>); — <grk>σαδωκ, σαδδονκ</grk> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 225 ff.</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b><sub>48</sub> priests: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> David's time <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:17\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1