38\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,38)\">1Chr 5:38</ref> (twice in verse), possibly = <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,11)\">1Chr 9:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 11:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,11)\">Neh 11:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> father-in-law of Uzziah <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,33)\">2Kgs 15:33</ref> = <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Chr 27:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,27,11)\">2Chr 27:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> two wall-builders: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,4)\">Neh 3:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> v<ref ref=\"Neh 3:29\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,29)\">Neh 3:29</ref> perhaps = <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 10:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,22)\">Neh 10:22</ref>, and <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>הַסּוֺפֵר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 13:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,13)\">Neh 13:13</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Kgs 1:26", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 1, "verse": 26}, {"raw": "2Sam 8:17", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "1Chr 18:16", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 18, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "2Sam 15:24", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "2Sam 15:25", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "1Kgs 2:35", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 2, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "1Chr 29:22", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 29, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "1Kgs